    "steam_appid": 2956330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956330/extras/4214d2168442e42bf4176a40ee5989d7.avif?t=1736341586\" width=607 height=124 /></span><br><br>Gender Neutral Chess is a chess variant where you can dynamically change your units during the game, opening up an astounding number of gameplay opportunities that add excitement to the original formula<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956330/extras/e610438d4b0bdc614f3578b5030b53b5.avif?t=1736341586\" width=607 height=125 /></span><br><br>You start with a standard layout and 6 transformation points. It takes one point to transform a piece to either a bishop, knight, or rook while it takes three points to transform into a queen. During the game, you get one point when you kill the opponent's bishop, knight, or rook, and three points if you kill the opponent's queen.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956330/extras/bd9f290a2fe4e2a2c3866f178cee0f59.avif?t=1736341586\" width=607 height=124 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">Online Multiplayer PVP</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">Singleplayer Games Against Stockfish Chess Engine</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">4 Game Modes - 10 Minutes, 15 Minutes|10 Seconds, 30 Minutes, Indefinite</ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956330/extras/4214d2168442e42bf4176a40ee5989d7.avif?t=1736341586\" width=607 height=124 /></span><br><br>Gender Neutral Chess is a chess variant where you can dynamically change your units during the game, opening up an astounding number of gameplay opportunities that add excitement to the original formula<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956330/extras/e610438d4b0bdc614f3578b5030b53b5.avif?t=1736341586\" width=607 height=125 /></span><br><br>You start with a standard layout and 6 transformation points. It takes one point to transform a piece to either a bishop, knight, or rook while it takes three points to transform into a queen. During the game, you get one point when you kill the opponent's bishop, knight, or rook, and three points if you kill the opponent's queen.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956330/extras/bd9f290a2fe4e2a2c3866f178cee0f59.avif?t=1736341586\" width=607 height=124 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">Online Multiplayer PVP</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">Singleplayer Games Against Stockfish Chess Engine</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">4 Game Modes - 10 Minutes, 15 Minutes|10 Seconds, 30 Minutes, Indefinite</ul>",
